  ARRAY['Dense, stemless clumps of arching, glossy dark green elliptic leaves with sunken veins', 'Pure snow-white, petal-like oval spathes emerging above the foliage on slender erect stalks', 'Central, creamy-yellow cylindrical spadix covered in tiny true flowers', 'Dramatic wilting behavior (''fainting'') when thirsty, followed by rapid full recovery within hours of watering']::text[],
  'Dense tropical rainforest understory floors, shaded riverbanks, and dimly lit home interiors.',
  'Native to tropical rainforests of Central and South America; universally cultivated as an indoor decorative houseplant.',
