  'A robust, drought-conquering succulent cactus composed of flattened paddle-like green stem segments (cladodes), yellow blossoms, and sweet, juicy, spine-armed oval fruits.',
  ARRAY['Segmented succulent shrub formed of thick, flattened, obovate green pad-like stem joints (cladodes)', 'Pads armed with clusters of minute, barbed hair-like bristles (glochids) and occasional sharp spines', 'Large, cup-shaped bright golden-yellow or orange flowers opening on the upper margins of terminal pads', 'Ovoid, fleshy berry fruits (tunas) ripening from green to ruby-red or purplish-crimson with sweet juicy seed-filled pulp']::text[],
