  'ডাম্ব কেন (Dumb Cane)',
  ARRAY['Dumb Cane', 'Leopard Lily', 'Tropic Snow', 'Amoena', 'Dieffenbachia']::text[],
  'A striking, upright tropical houseplant with cane-like stems and broad, dramatic emerald-green leaves intricately patterned with ivory, cream, and yellow variegation. HIGHLY TOXIC.',
  ARRAY['Stout, fleshy, bamboo-like cane stems with prominent leaf sheath scars', 'Large, broad oblong-elliptic leaves marbled with creamy-white and pale yellow splotches along the center', 'Thick, fleshy petioles with sheathing bases clasping the central cane', 'Rare greenish-white spathe-and-spadix inflorescences in indoor cultivation']::text[],
