  ARRAY['Tunicated subterranean bulb producing 2-6 broad, glaucous, fleshy grey-green leaves clasping the stem base', 'Single upright flowering scape carrying a solitary, symmetrical cup-shaped or goblet-shaped blossom', 'Six distinct, petal-like tepals (3 outer sepals and 3 inner petals) in solid, bicolored, or fringed hues', 'Six stamens with prominent dark anthers surrounding a three-lobed sessile stigma']::text[],
