  ARRAY['Tunicated subterranean ovoid bulb producing 4-6 flat, strap-like linear greyish-green leaves', 'Slender, flattened flowering stem bearing a solitary nodding or horizontal blossom', 'Six pale to golden-yellow spreading perianth segments (petals) surrounding a prominent, tubular central trumpet (corona)', 'Sweet delicate floral perfume and three-valved capsule containing small black seeds']::text[],
