  'A free-floating freshwater aquatic perennial with swollen bulbous spongy petioles, glossy round leaves, and spikes of stunning pale-violet flowers bearing a peacock-eye yellow spot. Highly invasive.',
  ARRAY['Free-floating aquatic rosette with swollen, bulbous, air-filled spongy petioles acting as natural buoyancy floats', 'Glossy, thick, rounded or broadly ovate dark green leaf blades', 'Massive, fibrous, feather-like dark purple-to-black submerged roots trailing in water', 'Spikes of 8-15 exquisite pale lavender-blue or violet flowers, with the top petal displaying a radiant blue halo around a bright golden-yellow spot']::text[],
